---
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';
---

<section class="why-us">
  <div class="why-us__inner">
    <div class="why-us__header">
      <p class="why-us__eyebrow">{zh ? '为什么选我们' : 'Why this trip'}</p>
      <h2 class="why-us__title">
        {zh ? '同样的价格，不一样的旅行' : "There are cheaper tours out there. Here's what's different."}
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="why-us__cards">

      <div class="why-us__card">
        <span class="why-us__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="why-us__card-title">
          {zh ? '学生领队，全程同行' : 'Student-led, every step'}
        </h3>
        <p class="why-us__card-body">
          {zh
            ? '除了专业导游，来自当地高校的中国学生联合领队全程陪同——他们真正生活在这里，知道去哪吃、夜晚去哪玩、如何像本地人一样穿梭其中。'
            : 'Beyond a professional guide, Chinese university students join as co-leads throughout — people who actually live there, know where to eat, what to do after dark, and how to move through the city like a local.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-us__card">
        <span class="why-us__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="why-us__card-title">
          {zh ? '不只是景点' : 'Built for real experiences'}
        </h3>
        <p class="why-us__card-body">
          {zh
            ? '派对、市集、特色夜宵、手工艺体验、展览……行程设计的目的是让你真正走进当地生活，而不只是隔着镜头拍照。'
            : 'Parties, pop-up markets, local food nights, craft workshops, exhibitions — the schedule is built so you step into daily life, not just photograph it from the outside.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-us__card">
        <span class="why-us__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="why-us__card-title">
          {zh ? '所有细节提前搞定' : 'Zero logistics on your end'}
        </h3>
        <p class="why-us__card-body">
          {zh
            ? 'VPN、移动支付、本地 SIM 卡、城市间交通——全部提前安排好。你只需要出现，其余的我们来处理。'
            : 'VPN, mobile payments, local SIM, transport between cities — sorted before you land. You show up, we handle the rest.'}
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
